					<p><a href="wp-content/uploads/2009/01/David-Hyams-4.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-892" title="David Hyams 4" src="wp-content/uploads/2009/01/David-Hyams-4-206x300.jpg" alt="" width="206" height="300" /></a></p>
